{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1414.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"dcdadef46c1829bd2383bd5fa8da97ebb16f6c3a9691eb820aa3b931c11eaf0e","ja":"うう～……ごめん！　あの曲を聞いたら、\nなんだか急に、走りたくなっちゃって……。","zh":"呜呜～……对不起！一听到那首歌，\n不知怎么就突然很想跑起来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:10:10+00:00"}
